  "settings.creditsDesc":["Author: {author} · Co-author: {co}","Auteur : {author} · Co-auteur : {co}","Autor: {author} · Coautor: {co}","作者：{author} · 共同作者：{co}","저자: {author} · 공동 저자: {co}","作者：{author} · 合作者：{co}","作者：{author} · 合作者：{co}"],
  "cmd.mock-paper":["Make a mock paper","Créer un sujet blanc","Crear un examen de práctica","模擬試験を作る","모의고사 만들기","生成模拟卷","產生模擬卷"],
  "ai.job.mock":["Mock paper","Sujet blanc","Examen de práctica","模擬試験","모의고사","模拟卷","模擬卷"],
  "ai.job.mockDesc":["A new exam paper modelled on past papers, with a source for every problem.","Un nouveau sujet sur le modèle des annales, avec la source de chaque exercice.","Un examen nuevo basado en exámenes anteriores, con la fuente de cada ejercicio.","過去問をもとにした新しい試験。各問題に出典付き。","기출문제를 바탕으로 한 새 시험지. 문제마다 출처 표시.","仿照往年真题出一套新试卷，每道题标注出处。","仿照往年考古題出一份新試卷，每道題標註出處。"],
  "mock.title":["Mock paper","Sujet blanc","Examen de práctica","模擬試験","모의고사","模拟卷","模擬卷"],
  "mock.intro":["Past papers set the format and difficulty; the chapters you choose set what may be tested; your weak spots get the new problems. Every problem says where it came from.","Les annales donnent la forme et la difficulté ; les chapitres choisis fixent le programme ; vos points faibles reçoivent les nouveaux exercices. Chaque exercice indique sa source.","Los exámenes anteriores marcan el formato y la dificultad; los capítulos elegidos, el temario; tus puntos débiles reciben los ejercicios nuevos. Cada ejercicio indica su fuente.","過去問で形式と難易度を、選んだ章で出題範囲を決め、新しい問題は弱点に集中させます。各問題に出典が付きます。","기출문제로 형식과 난이도를, 고른 단원으로 출제 범위를 정하고, 새 문제는 약점에 맞춥니다. 문제마다 출처가 붙습니다.","往年试卷决定题型和难度，所选章节决定考查范围，新题针对你的薄弱点。每道题都标注出处。","往年試卷決定題型和難度，所選章節決定考查範圍，新題針對你的弱點。每道題都標註出處。"],
  "mock.course":["Course","Cours","Asignatura","科目","과목","课程","課程"],
  "mock.papers":["Past papers to model on","Annales de référence","Exámenes anteriores de referencia","参考にする過去問","참고할 기출문제","参考的往年试卷","參考的往年試卷"],
  "mock.papersNone":["No past papers found in this course (files in 复习资料 or named exam, midterm, final, 期中, 期末…). All problems will be new.","Aucune annale trouvée dans ce cours (fichiers de 复习资料 ou nommés exam, midterm, final…). Tous les exercices seront nouveaux.","No se encontraron exámenes anteriores (archivos en 复习资料 o llamados exam, midterm, final…). Todos los ejercicios serán nuevos.","この科目に過去問が見つかりません（复习资料 内や exam・期中・期末 などの名前のファイル）。すべて新しい問題になります。","이 과목에서 기출문제를 찾지 못했습니다 (复习资料 안이나 exam, midterm, 期中 등 이름의 파일). 모두 새 문제가 됩니다.","这门课里没找到往年试卷（复习资料 中的文件，或名字含 exam、期中、期末等）。将全部出新题。","這門課裡沒找到往年試卷（复习资料 中的檔案，或名稱含 exam、期中、期末等）。將全部出新題。"],
